SUMMARY:(509) Iolanda hides a mag 11.7 star (just outside the path)
DESCRIPTION:(509) Iolanda hides a magnitude 11.7 star\, seen from Jaisalmer
 .\nThe predicted edge passes 14 km to the N\, so a miss is likely — but 
 a chord from near the edge is the most valuable observation of all.\nClose
 st approach 19:25:47 IST\, give or take 1 s. The star is 17° up in the WS
 W · dusk.\nIt fades 3.1 magnitudes for up to 1.4 s on the centre line\, a
 nd the path is 52 km wide\, give or take 29 km.\nFinder chart\, the map an
 d the path as KML: https://occult.alokm.com/asteroids-2026-09#2026-09-12-5
 09-iolanda-253504
